  "figure": {
    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>rose-statistic-reduce · 1×1×1 workgroups × 256×1×1 lanes = 256 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-rose-statistic-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 256\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-rose-statistic-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"256\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"8\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>256 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const startsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; starts: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const endsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read&gt; ends: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const weightsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"10\">@group(0) @binding(2) var&lt;storage, read&gt; weights: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const summaryOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"12\">@group(0) @binding(3) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; summary: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">const binsOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"14\">@group(0) @binding(4) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; bins: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">const ROWS: u32 = 894u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">const GROUP_COUNT: u32 = 1u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">const LANES: u32 = 256u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">const BIN_COUNT: u32 = 18u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">const PI: f32 = 3.141592653589793;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">const PERIOD: f32 = PI;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">fn isFiniteFloat(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileBin: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; tileWeight: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"26\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedCount: array&lt;u32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"27\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedWeight: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedCosine: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedSine: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedDirectionCosine: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">var&lt;workgroup&gt; sharedDirectionSine: array&lt;f32, 256&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"33\">@compute @workgroup_size(256)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"34\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  _ = &amp;starts;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  _ = &amp;ends;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">  _ = &amp;weights;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  _ = &amp;summary;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  _ = &amp;bins;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 16777216u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 256u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"49\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"50\">  let group = index / LANES;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"51\">  let lane = localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"52\">  let isActiveGroup = group &lt; GROUP_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"53\">  let binBase = binsOffset + group * BIN_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"54\">  if (isActiveGroup) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"55\">    for (var bin = lane; bin &lt; BIN_COUNT; bin += LANES) { bins[binBase + bin] = 0.0; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"56\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"57\">  var count = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"58\">  var weightTotal = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"59\">  var cosine = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"60\">  var sine = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"61\">  var directionCosine = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"62\">  var directionSine = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"63\">  for (var tile = 0u; tile &lt; ROWS; tile += LANES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"64\">    let row = tile + lane;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"65\">    let hasRow = isActiveGroup &amp;&amp; row &lt; ROWS;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"66\">    var rowBin = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"67\">    var rowWeight = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"68\">    if (hasRow) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"69\">      if (!(false)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"70\">        let start = vec2f(starts[startsOffset + row * 2u], starts[startsOffset + row * 2u + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"71\">        let end = vec2f(ends[endsOffset + row * 2u], ends[endsOffset + row * 2u + 1u]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"72\">        let delta = end - start;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"73\">        let lengthSquared = dot(delta, delta);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"74\">        let weight = weights[weightsOffset + row];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"75\">        if (lengthSquared &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; weight &gt; 0.0 &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(lengthSquared) &amp;&amp; isFiniteFloat(weight)) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"76\">          var angle = atan2(delta.y, delta.x);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"77\">          if (angle &lt; 0.0) { angle += 2.0 * PI; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"78\">          if (angle &gt;= PI) { angle -= PI; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"79\">          let circularAngle = 2.0 * angle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"80\">          let cosineAngle = cos(circularAngle);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"81\">          let sineAngle = sin(circularAngle);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"82\">          cosine += weight * cosineAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"83\">          sine += weight * sineAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"84\">          directionCosine += cosineAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"85\">          directionSine += sineAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"86\">          weightTotal += weight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"87\">          count++;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"88\">          rowBin = min(u32(floor(angle * f32(BIN_COUNT) / PERIOD + 1e-6)), BIN_COUNT - 1u);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"89\">          rowWeight = weight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"90\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"91\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"92\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"93\">    tileBin[lane] = rowBin;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"94\">    tileWeight[lane] = rowWeight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"95\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"96\">    if (isActiveGroup) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"97\">      for (var bin = lane; bin &lt; BIN_COUNT; bin += LANES) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"98\">        var added = 0.0;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"99\">        for (var other = 0u; other &lt; LANES; other++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"100\">          if (tileBin[other] == bin) { added += tileWeight[other]; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"101\">        }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"102\">        bins[binBase + bin] += added;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"103\">      }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"104\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"105\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"106\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"107\">  sharedCount[lane] = count;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"108\">  sharedWeight[lane] = weightTotal;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"109\">  sharedCosine[lane] = cosine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"110\">  sharedSine[lane] = sine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"111\">  sharedDirectionCosine[lane] = directionCosine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"112\">  sharedDirectionSine[lane] = directionSine;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"113\">  workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"114\">  for (var stride = LANES / 2u; stride &gt; 0u; stride /= 2u) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"115\">    if (lane &lt; stride) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"116\">      sharedCount[lane] += sharedCount[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"117\">      sharedWeight[lane] += sharedWeight[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"118\">      sharedCosine[lane] += sharedCosine[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"119\">      sharedSine[lane] += sharedSine[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"120\">      sharedDirectionCosine[lane] += sharedDirectionCosine[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"121\">      sharedDirectionSine[lane] += sharedDirectionSine[lane + stride];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"122\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"123\">    workgroupBarrier();\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"124\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"125\">  if (lane == 0u &amp;&amp; isActiveGroup) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"126\">    let base = summaryOffset + group * 5u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"127\">    summary[base] = f32(sharedCount[0]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"128\">    if (sharedWeight[0] &gt; 0.0) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"129\">      let totalWeight = sharedWeight[0];\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"130\">      var meanAngle = atan2(sharedSine[0], sharedCosine[0]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"131\">      if (meanAngle &lt; 0.0) { meanAngle += 2.0 * PI; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"132\">      meanAngle *= 0.5;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"133\">      let resultant = sqrt(sharedCosine[0] * sharedCosine[0] + sharedSine[0] * sharedSine[0]) / totalWeight;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"134\">      summary[base + 1u] = meanAngle;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"135\">      summary[base + 2u] = resultant;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"136\">      summary[base + 3u] = 1.0 - resultant;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"137\">      let validCount = f32(sharedCount[0]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"138\">      let rayleighZ = (sharedDirectionCosine[0] * sharedDirectionCosine[0] +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"139\">        sharedDirectionSine[0] * sharedDirectionSine[0]) / validCount;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"140\">      summary[base + 4u] = rayleighZ;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"141\">    } else {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"142\">      let nan = bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(0x7fc00000u | (group &amp; 0u));\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"143\">      for (var slot = 1u; slot &lt; 5u; slot++) { summary[base + slot] = nan; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"144\">    }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"145\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"146\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>starts<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"starts\">starts</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>ends<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"ends\">ends</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>weights<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"weights\">weights</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>summary<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"summary\">summary</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>bins<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"bins\">bins</td><td>read_write</td><td>f32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPURoseStatistic/axial · main · 39d244c8</figcaption></figure></section>",
